{"seq":1,"slug":"cellular-senescence-mechanisms","title":"细胞衰老机制：端粒、线粒体与衰老信号通路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/cellular-senescence-mechanisms","wordCount":1459,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"细胞衰老机制-端粒-线粒体与衰老信号通路\">细胞衰老机制：端粒、线粒体与衰老信号通路</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>细胞衰老（cellular senescence）是指细胞永久性退出增殖周期但保持代谢活性的状态。衰老细胞通过分泌促炎因子（SASP）加速组织功能衰退，是衰老的核心驱动力之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[正常细胞] --&gt; B{衰老触发因素}&#10;    B --&gt; C[端粒缩短]&#10;    B --&gt; D[线粒体功能障碍]&#10;    B --&gt; E[DNA损伤累积]&#10;    B --&gt; F[癌基因激活]&#10;    C --&gt; G[p53/p21通路激活]&#10;    D --&gt; H[ROS过度产生]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; I[p16/Rb通路激活]&#10;    G --&gt; J[细胞周期停滞]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; E&#10;    J --&gt; K[衰老细胞]&#10;    K --&gt; L[SASP分泌]&#10;    L --&gt; M[慢性炎症]&#10;    L --&gt; N[旁分泌衰老扩散]&#10;    L --&gt; O[组织功能衰退]\">graph TD\n    A[正常细胞] --&gt; B{衰老触发因素}\n    B --&gt; C[端粒缩短]\n    B --&gt; D[线粒体功能障碍]\n    B --&gt; E[DNA损伤累积]\n    B --&gt; F[癌基因激活]\n    C --&gt; G[p53/p21通路激活]\n    D --&gt; H[ROS过度产生]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; I[p16/Rb通路激活]\n    G --&gt; J[细胞周期停滞]\n    I --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; E\n    J --&gt; K[衰老细胞]\n    K --&gt; L[SASP分泌]\n    L --&gt; M[慢性炎症]\n    L --&gt; N[旁分泌衰老扩散]\n    L --&gt; O[组织功能衰退]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>衰老触发因素</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>关键通路</th>\n<th>下游效应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端粒缩短</td>\n<td>复制性磨损导致染色体末端暴露</td>\n<td>ATM/ATR → p53 → p21</td>\n<td>复制性衰老</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体损伤</td>\n<td>电子传递链异常产生过量ROS</td>\n<td>ROS → DNA损伤 → DDR</td>\n<td>氧化应激性衰老</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>癌基因应激</td>\n<td>异常增殖信号触发安全机制</td>\n<td>Ras/Raf → p16^{INK4a} → Rb</td>\n<td>癌基因诱导衰老(OIS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA损伤</td>\n<td>紫外线/辐射/化学物质</td>\n<td>DDR → p53/p21</td>\n<td>损伤诱导衰老</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表观遗传重编程失败</td>\n<td>染色质结构紊乱</td>\n<td>组蛋白修饰异常</td>\n<td>程序性衰老</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"端粒缩短与复制性衰老\">端粒缩短与复制性衰老</h2><p>端粒是位于染色体末端的重复DNA序列（TTAGGG），由Shelterin蛋白复合体保护。每次细胞分裂时，由于DNA聚合酶无法完全复制线性染色体的末端（末端复制问题），端粒序列丢失约50-200个碱基对。</p>\n<p>端粒缩短的量化关系可用以下模型近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_n = L_0 - n \\cdot \\Delta L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为初始端粒长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为分裂次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为每次分裂的平均损失（约50-200 bp）。</p>\n<p>当端粒缩短至临界长度（约4-6 kb）时，Shelterin 复合体无法维持保护性 T-loop 结构，暴露的染色体末端被识别为双链断裂（DSB），激活 DNA 损伤反应（DDR）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>端粒状态</th>\n<th>细胞响应</th>\n<th>Hayflick极限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>青年期</td>\n<td>10-15 kb</td>\n<td>正常增殖</td>\n<td>远离极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中年期</td>\n<td>6-10 kb</td>\n<td>增殖能力下降</td>\n<td>接近极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临界期</td>\n<td>4-6 kb</td>\n<td>DDR激活 → p53/p21</td>\n<td>达到极限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰老期</td>\n<td>&lt;4 kb</td>\n<td>永久性细胞周期停滞</td>\n<td>超越极限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>端粒酶（telomerase，由TERT和TERC组成）可延长端粒，但在大多数人体细胞中表达沉默，仅在干细胞、生殖细胞和约85%的癌细胞中活跃。ALT（Alternative Lengthening of Telomeres）是端粒酶阴性细胞维持端粒的替代途径，基于同源重组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线粒体功能障碍与氧化应激\">线粒体功能障碍与氧化应激</h2><p>线粒体是细胞的「能量工厂」，通过氧化磷酸化（OXPHOS）产生ATP。随年龄增长，线粒体DNA（mtDNA）突变累积、电子传递链效率下降、活性氧（ROS）产生增加，形成恶性循环。</p>\n<p>线粒体衰老的核心循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[mtDNA突变累积] --&gt; B[ETC复合体功能下降]&#10;    B --&gt; C[电子泄漏增加]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ROS过度产生]&#10;    D --&gt; E[mtDNA进一步损伤]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; F[脂质过氧化]&#10;    D --&gt; G[蛋白质氧化]&#10;    D --&gt; H[核DNA损伤]&#10;    B --&gt; I[ATP产生不足]&#10;    I --&gt; J[细胞能量危机]&#10;    J --&gt; K[线粒体自噬受损]&#10;    K --&gt; L[功能障碍线粒体累积]&#10;    L --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[mtDNA突变累积] --&gt; B[ETC复合体功能下降]\n    B --&gt; C[电子泄漏增加]\n    C --&gt; D[ROS过度产生]\n    D --&gt; E[mtDNA进一步损伤]\n    E --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; F[脂质过氧化]\n    D --&gt; G[蛋白质氧化]\n    D --&gt; H[核DNA损伤]\n    B --&gt; I[ATP产生不足]\n    I --&gt; J[细胞能量危机]\n    J --&gt; K[线粒体自噬受损]\n    K --&gt; L[功能障碍线粒体累积]\n    L --&gt; A</pre><p>线粒体衰老的关键分子事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>潜在干预靶点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>mtDNA突变积累</td>\n<td>缺乏组蛋白保护 + 修复能力有限</td>\n<td>ETC亚基功能异常</td>\n<td>线粒体靶向抗氧化剂(MitoQ)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAD⁺下降</td>\n<td>CD38表达增加消耗NAD⁺</td>\n<td>Sirtuin活性降低 → 代谢失调</td>\n<td>NMN/NR补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体自噬受损</td>\n<td>PINK1/Parkin通路效率下降</td>\n<td>损伤线粒体无法清除</td>\n<td>运动/Spermidine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线粒体动力学失衡</td>\n<td>融合(Mfn1/2)/分裂(Drp1)比例改变</td>\n<td>线粒体碎片化</td>\n<td>Mdivi-1(实验性)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPRmt钝化</td>\n<td>线粒体未折叠蛋白反应减弱</td>\n<td>蛋白质质控失效</td>\n<td>NAD⁺/热量限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sasp-衰老细胞的-毒性分泌组\">SASP——衰老细胞的「毒性分泌组」</h2><p>衰老相关分泌表型（Senescence-Associated Secretory Phenotype, SASP）是衰老细胞对周围微环境施加不良影响的核心途径。SASP组分包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>促炎细胞因子</strong>：IL-1α/β、IL-6、IL-8、TNF-α</li>\n<li><strong>趋化因子</strong>：CXCL1/2、MCP-1</li>\n<li><strong>基质金属蛋白酶</strong>：MMP-1/3/9（降解细胞外基质）</li>\n<li><strong>生长因子</strong>：VEGF、TGF-β、PDGF</li>\n<li><strong>外泌体</strong>：携带促衰老信号的胞外囊泡</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SASP的双面性值得注意：短期SASP参与伤口愈合和组织修复中的细胞清除；但持续性SASP驱动慢性低级别炎症（inflammaging），加速邻近细胞衰老（旁分泌衰老），促进肿瘤微环境形成。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SASP调控因子</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>抑制策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NF-κB</td>\n<td>SASP基因的核心转录因子</td>\n<td>雷帕霉素(间接)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C/EBPβ</td>\n<td>与NF-κB协同激活SASP</td>\n<td>尚无临床手段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mTOR</td>\n<td>通过翻译调控增强SASP</td>\n<td>雷帕霉素/Everolimus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>p38 MAPK</td>\n<td>应激信号→NF-κB激活</td>\n<td>SB203580(实验性)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cGAS-STING</td>\n<td>胞质DNA感知→干扰素响应</td>\n<td>STING抑制剂(研发中)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"衰老细胞的两条经典通路\">衰老细胞的两条经典通路</h2><p>细胞衰老的建立和维持依赖两条相互关联但独立的肿瘤抑制通路：</p>\n<p><strong>p53/p21通路</strong>（快速响应）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DDR信号通过ATM/ATR激酶稳定p53蛋白</li>\n<li>p53转录激活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mn>21</mn><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p21^{CIP1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（CDKN1A）</li>\n<li>p21抑制CDK2/Cyclin E复合体</li>\n<li>Rb蛋白保持去磷酸化状态 → E2F靶基因沉默 → G1停滞</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>p16/Rb通路</strong>（长期维持）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表观遗传去抑制导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mn>16</mn><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p16^{INK4a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（CDKN2A）表达上调</li>\n<li>p16抑制CDK4/6</li>\n<li>Rb保持低磷酸化 → 稳定的异染色质形成（SAHF）</li>\n<li>不可逆的增殖停止</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两条通路的关键差异在于：p53/p21通路可被逆转（若DDR信号消除），而p16/Rb通路建立后通常不可逆。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mn>16</mn><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p16^{INK4a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的累积被视为衰老细胞负荷的可靠标志物——在小鼠模型中，清除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msup><mn>16</mn><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p16^{INK4a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0358em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 阳性细胞（INK-ATTAC模型）显著延长了健康寿命。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>细胞衰老是多重应激信号汇聚的终点，也是组织衰老的起点。端粒缩短提供了衰老的「计时器」，线粒体损伤放大了氧化应激的恶性循环，而SASP将单个衰老细胞的影响扩散至整个组织。理解这三大机制的交织关系，是评估Senolytics、端粒酶激活剂和线粒体靶向治疗等干预手段的前提。下一篇将探讨表观遗传时钟如何量化这些累积损伤的总和。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细胞衰老机制：端粒、线粒体与衰老信号通路","id":"细胞衰老机制-端粒-线粒体与衰老信号通路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"端粒缩短与复制性衰老","id":"端粒缩短与复制性衰老"},{"level":2,"text":"线粒体功能障碍与氧化应激","id":"线粒体功能障碍与氧化应激"},{"level":2,"text":"SASP——衰老细胞的「毒性分泌组」","id":"sasp-衰老细胞的-毒性分泌组"},{"level":2,"text":"衰老细胞的两条经典通路","id":"衰老细胞的两条经典通路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"表观遗传时钟：DNA甲基化与生物年龄测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/epigenetic-clocks"}}